  "details": "**Note: Potentially Related To Mirroring Bugs on Beta**\n \n# Issue\nWhen in VR, the VRChat camera [controller] can be rotated **physically** 180º. By doing so, then pressing the \"Flip Camera\" button, the camera **does not rotate, nor switch**, but rather mirrors the current view. This effectively turns both sides into a selfie-camera, until the \"flip\" button is pressed again.\n \n# Expected Behavior\nBoth cameras rotate 180º\n \n# Exhibited Behavior\nThe \"rear\" camera rotates to face the player, in a mirrored fashion. If already facing the player, it is only mirrored.\n \n# Additional Notes\nThis has occurred previously on live & beta builds. Possibly related to desktop camera and new drone camera mirroring the view.",
